Looking at this problem, I need to prove two things: (1) the t-test is UMP-unbiased for testing $H_0: \mu = \mu_0$ vs $H_1: \mu \neq \mu_0$ with $\sigma^2$ as nuisance parameter, and (2) the corresponding confidence interval is UMAU at level $1-\alpha$.

